# Cursor Rules — Magrabi Deployment Portal

The single source of truth for rules, verification disciplines, and permissions is:
AGENTS.md

## Directives
1. Before performing tasks, review ENVIRONMENT_RUNBOOK.md and work_log/00_MASTER_CONTEXT.md.
2. Maintain work_log/ and .secrets/ as strictly gitignored.
3. Apply adversarial verification before declaring tasks complete.
4. Never print or log secret values; verify configuration by SHA-256 fingerprint hash.
5. All durable facts belong in ENVIRONMENT_RUNBOOK.md; logs belong in work_log/.
